{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o082a","title":"殷馗据黄星预言真人","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o082a-account","label":"正文","text":"正文追叙桓帝时殷馗据黄星预言五十年后真人兴起，并以曹操破袁绍相联系；这里只记录其星占说法。","evidence":["wudi-e-o082a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0185","role":"作星占预言","evidence":["wudi-e-o082a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"楚、宋分野及梁、沛","evidence":["wudi-e-o082a-q"]},"time":{"label":"桓帝时；正文以五十年相联系","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-o082a-q"]},"source_order":[1,439,"O082a"],"order":194}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0185","name":"殷馗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o082a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ea8b1be8bc7ce385783a","layer":"original","quote":"初，桓帝时有黄星现于楚、宋之分〖10〗。辽东殷馗善天文，﹝四﹞言：“五十岁当有真人起于梁、沛之间〖11〗，其锋不可当。”至是，凡五十年，而公破绍，天下莫敌矣。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
